                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Buyer beware!\n\nNegatives:\n- There isn't much game in this current state.\n- The quality is right there with the worst that came out of Early Access (Surprised they'd allowed this on sale).\n- Price is way too high, one can have far better and finished games for a fraction of the cost of this one.\n- The attitude of the developer is rather 'agressive' in the forums (young and his pet project so... He needs some time.)\n- What is there doesn't make me optimistic that it will improve much.\n- Bugs bugs and more bugs.\n\nTo be fair... it's an Early access title so most likely there will be bug fixes, content to be added. I am not optimistic on the capacities of the developer so I imagine the game itself won't be much better and never will be worth the price they will ask. \n\n\nMy advice to the developer: \nWork on your communication skills since the way you handle it atm will only draw in more people with negative opinions and even people who are just out to taunt you.\n\nKeep working hard on this title, while I understand it's your first game... it was way too early to put it on steam/ask money for it. \n\n\n",
